## God Speed（每会话）

Master orchestrator. Task-based routing; don't duplicate child rules — read them when triggered.

### 1. Voice（默认）

`caveman-mode.mdc` — terse, conclusion-first, no filler. **Off:** user says `normal mode` → full prose until they re-enable caveman.

### 2. Spec-first（编码任务 · 默认栈 · PRIORITY）

**Always:** `spec-kit-openspec-superpowers` — **priority skill**; treat as ON every session (99%). See `00-spec-first-superpowers.mdc`. 
Feature / bugfix / refactor / config → read skill + policy, triage Quick/Standard/Thorough, **G1 before code**. 
Layout / print / multi-option → **brainstorm + think-out path map + visual demo** first (`references/brainstorm-think-visual.md`); no code until pick.
Active PL: check `docs/SESSION_STATE.md`. **"skip spec"** → refuse; redirect `/super-spec`. 
Opt out: `no super-spec` / `plain agent`.

### 3. UI / Vue / CSS

`01-impeccable-ui.mdc` — polish, layout, forms, components, views. Load impeccable skill + `PRODUCT.md` context when present. Match PrimeVue + Tailwind; extend Direct Book shell patterns.

### 4. Execution bias

- Ship > debate. Minimal scope. Match codebase conventions.
- **Simple code:** short names, small methods (`04-simple-code-voice.mdc`).
- **SRP / avoid fat:** `srp-thin.md` via `/spec-kit-openspec-superpowers` Phase 4; deep = skill `refactor` (see §5).
- Verify before claiming done (`verification-before-completion`).
- After done: **Next 5** actions (`10-suggest-five-next.mdc`).
- Smoke/demo payloads: human EN+KM (`11-smoke-data-humanizer.mdc`) — no `smoke`/`test` junk in shared DB.
- Visual bugfixes: P1 query/data evidence, P2 crop optional (`07-bugfix-evidence-crop.mdc`).
- No drive-by refactors. No commits unless asked.

### 5. Quality + speed skills（按需 · 不预载）

Triad covers default flow. Load these **only on trigger** — read `SKILL.md`, then work.

| Trigger | Skill |
|---|-----|
| Review own/agent diff before merge · `review this` | `code-review-and-quality` (repo-local, 5 axes) |
| Review feels too agreeable · pre-merge risk · `hostile review` | `adversarial-reviewer` |
| PR / diff comments — one line each | `caveman-review` |
| Fat class, deep restructure beyond `srp-thin.md` | `refactor` (Fowler catalog) |
| Write PHP tests · TDD a feature/bugfix | `laravel-tdd` (Pest) |
| Pre-PR / pre-deploy full check | `laravel-verification` |
| Whole module broken — "make X work", empty tab class | `focused-fix` |

**Skip:** `code-review` / `code-reviewer` / `pr-review-expert` (overlap 5-axis) · `review` / `fix` (Playwright — archived) · `performance-profiler` (no Laravel) · `tdd-guide` (superseded by `laravel-tdd`).

One skill per task. Stacking reviewers burns tokens without new signal.

### 6. Multitask

**Default off** — see `03-fast-mode.mdc`. Long independent work → background subagents only when user says **`god speed full`** or **`multitask`**.

### 7. Session boot

1. **Default stack ON:** `spec-kit-openspec-superpowers` (no need to attach — 99% workflow)
2. `.spec-mode` → OpenSpec (`openspec`)
3. Read `docs/SESSION_STATE.md` on `continue`
4. Resume `openspec/changes/*/progress.md` + `task_plan.md` if present
5. Claude Senior listener + caveman; **no** agent-browser / Playwright (archived — `16-playwright-archived.mdc`)
6. Route task → spec + impeccable as needed
7. **Model route:** Claude subscription → OpenCodex → Cursor Task ladder — see `15-model-route-priority.mdc`

